<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Engelhard cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Engelhard cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney said Monday it had cut its rating for Engelhard Corp to outperform from buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Iselin, N.J., company were off 1-1/8 to 19-7/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
